hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"22334","Abdullah narrated to us, Abu Ayyub the companion of al-Basri, Sulayman ibn Ayyub, narrated to us, Harun ibn Dinar narrated to us, from his father, he said: I heard a man from the companions of the Prophet (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) called Maymun ibn Sunbad say: The Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) said: The support of my nation is by its wicked. He said it three times."
